# Commit hygiene

Refuse to add:
- `.cursor/mcp.json` (global file belongs at `~/.cursor/mcp.json`)
- `.env`, tokens, API keys, absolute `/Users/<name>/` adapter paths
- `local_adapters/`, Ollama models, `.gguf`, `.nvdb` caches, Niagara sim caches

Public MCP examples must use `${HOME}/local_tools/...` and `127.0.0.1`.

When asked to "just put the MCP in the repo," point at `schemas/mcp.example.json` and `docs/security.md` instead.
